4.8 Sustainability Plan
The project was designed to continue benefiting the school beyond the KCSE assessment period.
The following sustainability measures were proposed:
•	Retain part of the profits to finance future poultry projects.
•	Continue rearing improved Kienyeji chickens annually.
•	Maintain accurate production and financial records.
•	Train future Agriculture candidates using the established enterprise.
•	Continue practicing climate-smart poultry management.
•	Maintain the poultry house and equipment through regular servicing.
